WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.378
Welcome to Ivy Clinics. In a few minutes you will see how the app works for your clients, and how the team runs everything in the admin panel.

00:00:09.483 --> 00:00:16.702
This is the app. The home screen shows your next appointment, your next class, and a nudge when it is time for a check-up.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:24.420
Rather just ask? Type or say it to Ivy, for example: can I still take a calm class on Thursday after six?

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.641
Ivy looks it up and books it for you.

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:32.005
Under Book you choose a treatment and the clinic near you.

00:00:32.005 --> 00:00:35.074
Not sure yet? Start with a free consultation.

00:00:36.483 --> 00:00:43.366
Then you pick your specialist, a day and a time. Moving or cancelling is free up to twenty-four hours ahead.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:51.864
Classes shows the schedule for the next two weeks: reformer pilates, mat pilates, yoga, barre and stretch.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:57.108
In a reformer class you pick your own reformer, by the window for instance.

00:00:57.108 --> 00:00:59.679
In a mat class you get a fixed spot straight away.

00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:05.602
Your class then sits in your wallet. Scan the code at the door and you are checked in.

00:01:07.017 --> 00:01:13.056
The shop has the products our specialists use themselves, with aftercare tips for your treatment.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:21.021
My Ivy holds all your appointments, classes and orders. This is also where you choose your language: the app comes in six languages.

00:01:22.417 --> 00:01:26.355
And on a computer everything works just the same, as an ordinary website.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:35.514
Then the admin panel, for the team. At the top are today's numbers: revenue, treatments, how full the classes are, and the webshop.

00:01:36.917 --> 00:01:41.082
Below you see the four clinics from above. Each chair is a treatment room.

00:01:41.082 --> 00:01:44.066
Green means someone is being treated there right now.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:51.036
The diary shows the whole day per room. Each block is an appointment, and the green line is now.

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:58.885
On the right, everything that just happened comes in: new bookings, payments and orders, newest at the top.

00:02:00.283 --> 00:02:06.655
Classes live shows the studio during class. Light green is booked, dark green means someone has already checked in.

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:11.971
The webshop card shows what is selling today, and what is about to run out.

00:02:13.383 --> 00:02:18.143
At the bottom you see the revenue for the whole week, and tips the system draws from the numbers.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:26.587
Want to see a whole day at once? Press Play the day. And the Guide button walks you through everything step by step.

00:02:27.983 --> 00:02:33.409
That was Ivy Clinics: one app for your clients, and one overview for your team.

00:02:33.409 --> 00:02:33.821
Enjoy!
